# Absorb full-pipeline audit checklist

- [ ] Treat baseline and archived runs as bounded historical evidence, not production truth.
- [ ] Compare grading, enumeration and synthesis axes without collapsing missing data into success.
- [ ] Preserve run identity and source hashes in every generated report.
- [ ] Write only to an explicitly selected current run evidence directory.
- [ ] Do not call models, DBs, tmux, Devin, Solver or the network.
